1048 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I\031ve always wanted to collaborate with a party outside of the computer science department\054 on a project that leverages my technical expertise with a subject matter that is tangible\054 physical\054 and new\073 a project centered around micro\055forests checks those boxes quite nicely\041 I also feel compelled by the project\031s mission to improve education\054 spread awareness\054 and increase the impact of micro\055forests in the surrounding area\056 Developing this software is a way for me to contribute by doing what I do best\056)
     /K [ 21 ]
     /P 1049 0 R
     /Pg 1006 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

