1052 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The project serves three different user bases\072 contributors\054 stewards and observers\056 Contributors can scan QR codes on plants in participating micro\055forests to report data on their health and growth\056 Stewards have big\055picture statistics at their fingertips\054 to inform important decisions for their micro\055forests\056 Curious observers can visit an interactive\054 educational web page to learn about the project\031s impact and find ways to get involved\041)
     /K [ 23 ]
     /P 1053 0 R
     /Pg 1006 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

